@Comment:	MOT dominates this activity , and EXP plays a significant part in trying to get Chi to play as well. Mot and Chi seem reserved in their play with the magnets. Many pieces are kept in the box until EXP tells them that they can take them out. There isn't a lot of experimentation. Mot notices that the turtle isn't magnetic , which is about the extent of magnetic exploration. The time is spent stacking objects. Video tape does not start until later; transcription until then is solely from audio
